#, python-format
msgid ""
"These files are kept with the versions of their document: while the document exists, only a system administrator can delete them, attach them to another record or change their content.\n"
"%s"
msgstr ""
"Aquests fitxers es conserven amb les versions del seu document: mentre el document existeixi, només un administrador del sistema els pot eliminar, adjuntar a un altre registre o canviar-ne el contingut.\n"
"%s"
